        art='Batik Malaysia (vibrant wax-resist hand-painted floral silk and cotton textiles, distinctly featuring bold botanical motifs without human or animal figures); Songket weaving; Pewter craftsmanship (Royal Selangor, world\'s largest pewter manufacturer); Woodcarving of Kelantan and Terengganu.',
