        literature='Hikayat Hang Tuah (classical Malay epic of chivalry); Sejarah Melayu (Malay Annals, UNESCO Memory of the World); modern national laureates (Sasterawan Negara) Usman Awang, A. Samad Said, and modern authors Tash Aw and Tan Twan Eng ("The Garden of Evening Mists").',
