        sports='Badminton is a passionate national sport (legendary icons Lee Chong Wei, Aaron Chia / Soh Wooi Yik Olympic medalists); Track Cycling (Azizulhasni Awang "Pocket Rocketman" Olympic medalist); Squash (Nicol David, eight-time World Champion and greatest female squash player of all time); Sepak Takraw; Football (Harimau Malaya).',
