        flagDescription='Fourteen alternating horizontal stripes of red and white (representing the equal status of the 13 states and the federal government), with a dark blue canton bearing a yellow crescent moon (symbolizing Islam) and a 14-pointed star known as the Bintang Persekutuan (Jalur Gemilang / Stripes of Glory).',
