        airports=['Chinggis Khaan International Airport (UBN in Khöshig Valley - state-of-the-art international gateway opened in 2021)', 'Buyant-Ukhaa Airport (former international airport, now domestic and charter hub)', 'Khovd Airport', 'Ölgii Airport', 'Mörön Airport'],
