        holidays=['Constitution Day (September 20)', 'Dashain (October/November - 5 days)', 'Tihar (November - 3 days)', 'Nepali New Year (Baisakh 1 / mid-April)', 'Maha Shivaratri', 'Buddha Jayanti', 'Holi', 'International Women\'s Day (March 8)'],
        crafts='Handwoven Dhaka fabric (Dhaka topi hats and shawls from Palpa), handmade Lokta Daphne bush paper, hand-knotted Tibetan wool carpets, silver filigree jewelry, and singing bowls.',
